OL,3,GCentral, Tayside & Fife
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FCloudy with heavy rain
OL,6,Fspreading eastwards and clearing by
OL,7,Fmidday. Then a largely dry afternoon
OL,8,Fwith sunny spells developing, but also
OL,9,Fa few showers. Fresh winds easing
OL,10,Fthrough the day.
OL,11,
OL,12,CTonight:FA mainly dry evening with
OL,13,Flengthy clear spells for most places,
OL,14,Fperhaps the odd light shower at first.
OL,15,FDry through the rest of the night with
OL,16,Fwinds becoming lighter.
OL,17,
OL,18,CThursday:FA dry day with lengthy sunny
OL,19,Fspells between patchy amounts of
OL,20,Fcloud. More in the way of cloud for
OL,21,FUpper Tayside but still remaining dry.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
